# Search scope only. Preserve downloaded documentation, source, and licenses on disk.
# For a dependency investigation, use --no-ignore with its explicit directory.

# Agent docs, plans and Research/ are gitignored (not published) but stay searchable.
# These come first so the exclusions below still win inside them.
